SUMMARY:🌕 Gemini New Moon Sound Immersion with David Heiss🌕
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Star Sounds with David Heiss**\n**Speci
 alizing in Astrological Events and Sound Healing Journeys**\nStep into the
  energy of the Gemini New Moon for an evening of deep restoration\, reflec
 tion\, and vibrational alignment at the beautiful Light Center in Black Mo
 untain\, NC.\nThis special gathering invites you into a meditative sound j
 ourney designed to calm the nervous system\, quiet the noise of the outer 
 world\, and awaken clarity within. The Gemini New Moon opens a portal for 
 fresh perspectives\, new conversations with the soul\, and the opportunity
  to reset the mind and heart in powerful ways.\nThrough the immersive tone
 s of gongs\, singing bowls\, and healing frequencies\, we will create spac
 e to release mental overload\, reconnect with intuition\, and align with t
 he changing energies of this pivotal time. Gemini governs communication\, 
 thought patterns\, curiosity\, and the bridges between worlds. Under this 
 New Moon\, we work with sound as a language beyond words.\nHeld in the pea
 ceful mountain energy of the Light Center\, this experience is both ground
 ing and expansive... an invitation to slow down\, breathe deeply\, and lis
 ten inward.\nCome as you are. **Bring a yoga mat\, blanket\, pillow\, wate
 r\, and anything needed to remain comfortable while lying down during the 
 sound immersion.**\nThe New Moon is a beginning.\nSound is the bridge.\nYo
 ur presence is the activation.\nThis is not an ordinary Gemini New Moon.\n
 Gemini rules the mind\, communication\, perception\, learning\, and the pa
 thways that connect us to one another. With Uranus now in Gemini for the f
 irst time in over 80 years\, the collective mental field is beginning to a
 waken in radical new ways. Sudden insights\, accelerated intuition\, nervo
 us system activation\, breakthroughs in consciousness\, and completely new
  ways of seeing reality are all part of this unfolding cycle.\nThis New Mo
 on acts like an energetic doorway.\nA whisper from the future.\nA chance t
 o reset the mind\, release stale energy\, and open to a higher frequency o
 f awareness.\n**The evening will begin with a brief astrology transmission
  exploring the deeper meaning of this powerful New Moon and the awakening 
 influence of Uranus in Gemini.** We will then journey into an immersive go
 ng sound healing **In the Dome** featuring several gongs\, crystal and Tib
 etan bowls\, and other deeply resonant instruments designed to calm the mi
 nd\, awaken the spirit\, and realign the nervous system with the rhythms o
 f nature and cosmos.\n**This will be an evening of stillness\, wonder\, ac
 tivation\, and connection beneath the living sky.**\nCome ready to listen.
 \nCome ready to receive.\nCome ready to remember that magic is still real.
 \n\\#\\#\\# 👤 **About David Heiss**\nDavid Heiss is an **Evolutionary A
 strologer and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guiding others into deeper self
 -awareness through vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 2012\, he has work
 ed with the transformative power of **gongs and astrology**\, following a 
 profound awakening that shifted his life toward a path of healing and inne
 r discovery.\nFind him here: [https://www.starsounds.love/](https://www.st
 arsounds.love/)\nHis work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intelligence** (unde
 rstanding your soul’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direct vibrational e
 xperience)\n\nCreating a space where participants can **remember who they 
 are on a deeper level**.\nHis intention is simple and precise: to help you
  **experience yourself more fully**.\n**Get your tickets and spot here:**[
 StarSounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-details/gemini-new-moon-soun
 d-immersion-with-david-heiss)\n**Tickets: $30 in advance\; day of event $3
 5**
